    "directions": [
      "Add water to a large pot and bring to a boil.",
      "Cut skinless chicken into 2 pieces, and dash the chicken into the pot along with the pumpkin. Then add salt, pepper, pimento and mix together and boil for 20 minutes on medium heat.",
      "Add onions, spring onions, sweet potatoes or white potatoes, yam, carrots, cho cho, and bring to boil for 15 minutes.",
      "Then add Dumplings and spinners along with 1 whole scotch bonnet pepper and cook for further 15 minutes.",
      "Then add your Pumpkin and cock soup mix and stir well and simmer for 5-10 minutes"
    ],
